WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Select the prepared order in Smart Bridge. Personal values are masked.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Start the guided run from the extension. Smart Bridge transfers the prepared information into supported portal fields. Your team retains control of review and submission.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:27.000
The portal flags an eligibility requirement. Your team must review and resolve it.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Review applicant information populated in the portal.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Travel and accommodation fields are populated. Check the details against the documents, and resolve any warnings before submission.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Supporting documents now appear in the portal's upload fields. Your team checks that the required attachments are present and match the application.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.000
The portal saves an incomplete draft. Final review and submission are still required.
